{
  "format": 1,
  "title": "Build a Menu",
  "summary": "Give a button a menu, add buttons to it, name them, and choose how they look.",
  "order": 4,
  "practice": "../_scenes/shape_cube_controls.blend",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Step 1: Pick the Button",
      "text": [
        "1. In the Kneady tab, click the arrow beside Region 1.",
        "2. Click Button 1 under it.",
        "",
        "Button 1 rounds and twists the cube, as you left it. A button can also open a menu of more buttons, in a ring around it: you build it here."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "01_pick.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "window_manager.kneady_row",
          "is": 1
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "mode": "OBJECT",
        "select": [
          "Cube"
        ],
        "active": "Cube",
        "sidebar": "Kneady",
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        },
        "set": [
          {
            "path": "scene.kneady_on",
            "value": true
          },
          {
            "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].tree_open",
            "value": false
          },
          {
            "path": "window_manager.kneady_row",
            "value": -1
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 2: Give It a Menu",
      "text": [
        "1. At the bottom of Button 1's settings, turn on Opens Menu.",
        "",
        "Now a click on Button 1 opens its menu. A drag still rounds and twists the cube."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "02_opens_menu.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].opens_menu"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].opens_menu",
          "is": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 3: Add Buttons to It",
      "text": [
        "1. Press Add to Its Menu. The new button shows in the tree under Button 1, and is picked.",
        "2. Click Button 1 again and press Add to Its Menu once more."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "03_add.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].button_count",
          "at_least": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 4: Name Them",
      "text": [
        "1. Double-click the first new button's name in the tree (or Ctrl+click it), type Round and press Enter.",
        "2. Name the other one Twist the same way."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "04_name.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[1].name",
          "is": "Round"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].name",
          "is": "Twist"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 5: Show Their Names",
      "text": [
        "1. Click Round in the tree and set its Icon to Text.",
        "2. Do the same for Twist.",
        "",
        "A text button shows its name instead of arrows."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "05_text.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[1].icon_type",
          "is": "TEXT"
        },
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[2].icon_type",
          "is": "TEXT"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 6: One Color for the Menu",
      "text": [
        "1. Click Button 1 in the tree.",
        "2. Under Opens Menu, turn on Override Color.",
        "3. Click the swatch beside it and pick a color.",
        "",
        "Every button in the menu takes that one color."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "06_color.mp4",
          "label": "In the Kneady tab",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].menu_use_color"
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "path": "objects[\"Cube\"].kneady.regions[0].buttons[0].menu_use_color",
          "is": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Step 7: Open It",
      "text": [
        "1. Move the mouse over the cube and click Button 1: its menu opens, Round and Twist around it.",
        "2. Press Esc to close it.",
        "",
        "Round and Twist do nothing yet: give each a drag in its settings, as in the tutorials before."
      ],
      "media": [
        {
          "file": "07_open.mp4",
          "label": "In the viewport",
          "paragraph": 0,
          "recorded": {
            "blender": "5.2",
            "kneady": "1.0.0"
          }
        }
      ],
      "done_when": [
        {
          "operator": "kneady.drag",
          "with": {
            "target": "Cube",
            "region": 1,
            "button": 0
          },
          "moved": false
        }
      ],
      "start": {
        "view": {
          "location": [
            0.0,
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "rotation": [
            0.71238,
            0.44106,
            0.28736,
            0.46412
          ],
          "distance": 10.0,
          "perspective": "PERSP"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
